dsh-fc-games third-party notices
================================

1. jsnes 2.1.0
--------------
Source: https://github.com/bfirsh/jsnes
License: Apache License 2.0 (see vendor/jsnes-LICENSE.txt)
Usage: bundled verbatim as vendor/jsnes.min.js and concatenated into client.js.
The plugin drives jsnes' NES core and adapts its canvas/Web Audio approach for
video output and sound.

2. Game metadata and cover images
---------------------------------
Game search and file metadata come from public sources: the Internet Archive
APIs, a curated GitHub NES collection, user-defined JSON sources, and game
pages the user explicitly adds by URL. Cover images are public images attached
to those sources and are displayed from the original hosts; the plugin does not
redistribute them. Game titles, artwork, and ROMs remain the property of their
respective rights holders.

3. Game data
------------
The plugin contains no ROMs. Game files (direct `.nes` files or `.nes` entries
inside ZIP archives) are fetched from the selected source only when the user
explicitly starts a game. Users are responsible for playing only games they are
legally entitled to play.
